          "id": "f17762fe-d14e-4247-892b-9a90502ef5ee",
          "memory": "On October 3, 2026 User was folding laundry while User's cat supervised by sitting only on the clean load as usual, while Devon's cat was screaming for treats, got one treat and immediately wanted more.",
