        {
          "id": "399c43fd-4cfa-4bda-9870-cff46bd03d46",
          "memory": "On October 3, 2026 User confirmed to Devon that Luigi's is on 5th Street by the bank construction, with easier parking in the back lot, so Devon could share the location with a coworker who asked where it was.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "e46c01fe-9141-49db-8120-712f90afc2e8",
          "memory": "Around October 2, 2026 User and Devon ate massive pepperoni slices at Mario's and were still full on October 3, each with a leftover slice in the fridge, with Devon planning to reheat his for dinner using the pan trick with a water splash and lid instead of microwave.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "bd94caa5-8fb1-44fd-892b-f54cab3456fc",
          "memory": "As discussed on October 3, 2026, User asked if Devon reheated Rosa's thin-crust margherita leftovers with the pan trick, Devon said the thin crust was gone the same night, and both joked the garlic knots didn't make it home because Devon ate his in the car with no shame.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "e436c401-ac69-479a-adc8-0f7ca5840fa1",
          "memory": "On October 3, 2026 User said User never went snack shopping and was still low on snacks, having instead eaten the frozen lemon pepper chicken frozen the prior week, which User said still holds up.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "ebb26725-2417-4589-aafa-7e197817af97",
          "memory": "On October 3, 2026 Devon's mom texted about lunch on October 4, 2026 and said she will make extra potato salad because User is probably coming, with User saying to tell her User loves her and will come by after noon-ish while Devon teased User about demolishing it last time.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "ae19be13-762d-4481-ba47-9707fb68e13d",
          "memory": "On October 3, 2026 Devon planned a quick grocery run with his mom that afternoon for another mile-long list despite having stocked up the prior weekend, declining User's offer of help and saying he had it and it should be quick.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "2d53f2d6-3351-4097-89de-bb61554fe83b",
          "memory": "On October 3, 2026 Devon said he had peanut butter toast again that morning after a toast era, with User calling peanut butter toast elite and telling Devon not to hate.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "f71b787f-349c-4cfe-a463-78636b28645d",
          "memory": "On October 3, 2026 User planned to brave the store before it gets busy and to take Oak Street instead if 5th Street is still blocked by the bank construction, with Devon asking User to text if 5th is blocked.",
